+// damage (977992) ahead of you. Lightning Shield damage takes 10 sec off Elemental Mastery's cooldown, and Lightning
+// Bolt or Chain Lightning cast with 3 or more Maelstrom Weapon stacks takes 6 more off. (Stormstrike's cooldown cut and
+// Lightning Shield's damage bonus are already in the spell data.)
