+// damage, slower swings, up to 5); a plain auto attack clears them, so Heroic Strike keeps them going. At 5 stacks you
+// are Ready to Strike (977706): your next melee swing also Crushes enemies in front of you (977703, 630% unnormalized
+// weapon damage).
