+// Beast and Blade (978237): Rogue abilities that award combo points give your tamed beast a stack of Pack Tactics
+// (979038: +15% damage, 10% against players, and -5% damage taken per stack, up to 5, 10 sec). Single-target Rogue
+// finishers have a 20% chance per combo point to trigger Double Team (300185 on you, which raises your pet's special
+// attack damage by 70%, plus its marker 954625 on the pet). While Pack Tactics is up, the pet's special attacks give you
+// 10 energy (spell_wcme_pack_tactics).
