+// Serpent Form (982400): Cat Form shows as Serpent Form (982401), Claw as Serpent Strike (92366-92373), Rake as Puncture
+// (997765-997771), Rip as Serpent Venom (997746-997754) and Ferocious Bite as Venomous Fury, each at your level's rank.
+// In Serpent Form your auto attacks also deal Poisonous Strikes (92374, Instant Poison's modifiers apply), and Serpent
+// Strike hits add its poison buff (92375).
+class spell_wcme_serpent_form : public AuraScript
+{
+    PrepareAuraScript(spell_wcme_serpent_form);
+
