+// Swashbuckler: Bloodsail Captain (997127): Devastate shows as Hammer the Gap (92786 ranks), Eviscerate as Panache
+// (92789 ranks) and Slice and Dice as Blurred Blade (92787 ranks), each at your level's rank. Mocking Blow grants En
+// Garde! (92785). Captain's Resolve (300110) is kept on you while Swashbuckling (a single one-handed weapon and an
+// empty off-hand) in Defensive Stance, checked every quarter second. Blurred Blade is not refreshed by effects that refresh
